{"format":"kards-original-reference","version":1,"id":"ad1b4d70ec758e0b","name":"card_event_vanguard_ita","package":"/Game/Blueprints/Cards/Italy/events/card_event_vanguard_ita","parent":"UBaseCardObject","card":{"title":"VANGUARD","text":"A friendly Alpine unit gets Blitz and \"Damage dealt by this unit adds equal defense to your HQ.\"","flavorText":"In military terms, a \"vanguard\" refers to the forward element or the leading part of a military formation or operation. The vanguard typically consists of troops or units that are at the forefront of an advance and its primary purpose is to scout, secure, and potentially engage with the enemy or any potential threats ahead of the main force. The vanguard's role is crucial in providing critical information to the commanding officers about the enemy's strength, position, and terrain conditions. The concept of a vanguard is not limited to ground forces; it can also be applied to naval and aerial operations. In the context of naval operations, the vanguard might refer to ships or submarines at the front of a fleet or task force. In aerial operations, it could apply to fighter or reconnaissance aircraft that lead the way in an air campaign. The vanguard is an essential component of military strategy and tactics, as it helps ensure the safety and success of the larger force by providing critical intelligence and early engagement capabilities.","faction":"Italy","type":"order","rarity":"Common","cost":2,"operationCost":0,"attack":0,"defense":0},"defaults":{"UberGraphFrame":{},"Name":"card_event_vanguard_ita","title":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_event_vanguard_ita_title","SourceString":"VANGUARD","LocalizedString":"VANGUARD"},"Type":"ETypeEnum::order","faction":"EFactionEnum::Italy","kredits":2,"Text":{"Namespace":"card_italy","Key":"card_event_vanguard_ita_text","SourceString":"A friendly Alpine unit gets Blitz and \"Damage dealt by this unit adds equal defense to your HQ.\"","LocalizedString":"A friendly Alpine un